          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FCbWriter*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UInt64",
      "docs": "The size of buffer (in bytes) required to serialize the fields that have been written.\nIt is not valid to call this function in the middle of writing an object, array, or field."
    },
